         <div type="edition" xml:lang="san-Latn" rendition="class:00000 maturity:00000"><!-- update the values of @xml:lang and @rendition according to the language and source script of your text-->
            <!--edition goes here-->
<p><pb n="1v"/><!--First plate, reverse.-->
<lb n="1"/> [dextrorotatory spiral] svasti – caturudadhisalilavīcīmekhalānilīnāyāṁ sadvīpā-
<lb n="2"/>garapattanavatyā vasundharāyāṁ gauptāvde varṣaśatattraye varttamāne
<lb n="3"/>mahā<space type="binding-hole"/>rājādhirājāśśrīśaśāṅkarājye śāsati gagaṇatala-
<lb n="4"/>vini<space type="binding-hole"/>sṛtabhagīrathāvatāritāyā himavadgirer apari-
<lb n="5"/>patanānekaśilāsaṁhātavibhinnavahiḫpātālāttarjjalaughai
<lb n="6"/>surasarita Iva vividhataruvarakusumasañchannobhayataṭā- 
<!--	1–2. sadvīpāgarapattanavatyā: Hultzsch emends sadvīpagiripattanavatyāṁ.
 	3. mahārājādhirājāśśrīśaśāṅkarājye: Hultzsch emends mahārājādhirājaśrīśaśāṅkarāje.
	4. vinisṛta-: Hultzsch emends viniḥsṛta-.
	4–5. aparipatanānekaśilāsaṁhātavibhinna-: Hultzsch reads upari- and emends -patanād anekaśilāsaṁghāta-.
	5. -pātālāttarjjalaughai: Hultzsch hesitantly emends -pātālāntarjjalaughāyāḥ.
-->

Second plate, obverse.
<lb n="7"/>ntavinipatitajalāśayāyāḥ ś(ā)limāsaritaḥ kulā(pa)kaṇṭhā-
<lb n="8"/>d vejayakoṅgādāt mahārājamahāsāmantaśrīmādhavarājasya priyatanayo
<lb n="9"/>mahārājā yaśobhītas tasyāpi priyasūnuḥ svaguṇa(ma)rīcinikara-
<lb n="10"/>pravo<space type="binding-hole"/>dhitaśilodbhavakulakamalo vikośanīlotpala-
<lb n="11"/>prati<space type="binding-hole"/>sparddhinīkhaḍgadhārāniśitaniśśeṣapratihataripu-
<lb n="12"/>valo dīnānāthakṛpaṇavanīpakopabhujyamānavibhavaḥ svabhu-
<lb n="13"/>japarighayugalopārjjitanṛpaśrī kamalavimalaruthara-
<!--	
	7–8. kulā(pa)kaṇṭhād: Hultzsch emends kulopakaṇṭhād.
	8. vejayakoṅgādāt: Hultzsch reads -koṅgedāt and emends vijayakoṅgedād. The desired reading, however, is vijayakoṅgodād.
	11. pratisparddhinīkhaḍgadhārāniśitaniśśeṣapratihararipu-: Hultzsch notes that niśita ought to stand before for khaḍgadhārā, and pratihata before niśśeṣa.
	13. nṛpaśrī: Hultzsch emends -nṛpaśrīḥ.
	13. -ruthara-: Hultzsch emends -rucira-.
-->

Second plate, reverse.
<lb n="14"/>tanur jaganmalamaṇḍanaśrutaśauryadhairyaguṇānvito mahāvṛṣabhaparyaṅka-
<lb n="15"/>kakudhopadhānavinyastavāhor vvālacandrodyotitajaṭākalāpaikade-
<lb n="16"/>śasya <space type="binding-hole"/> bhagavatas sthityutpattipralayasṛṣṭisaṅhārakāraṇasya
<lb n="17"/>nṛbhuva<space type="binding-hole"/>naguroḫ pādabhaktaḥ paramavrahmaṇyo mahārājamāhāsā-
<lb n="18"/>mantaśrīmādhavarājaḥ kuśalī kṛṣṇagiriviṣayasaṁvaddhacchavala-
<lb n="19"/>kkhayagrāme varttamānabhaviṣyakkumārāmātyoparikatadāyuktakān anyāś ca
<lb n="20"/>yathārha pūjayati mānayati ca viditam astu bhavatām ayaṁ grāmo
<!--	
	14. jaganmala-: Hultzsch emends jaganmaṇḍala-.
	14. -śaurya-, -dhairya and -paryaṅka-: it looks as though the akṣaras rya are written here with y below ra, rather than with repha atop ya.
	15. -kakudhopa-: Hultzsch emends -kakudopa-.
	15. -candrodyotita-: Hultzsch emends -candroddyotita-.
	17. nṛbhuvana-: Hultzsch emends tribhuvana-.	
	19. -bhaviṣyakkumā-: Hultzsch emends -bhaviṣyatkumā-.
	19. anyāś:  Hultzsch emends anyāṁś.
	20. yathārha: Hultzsch emends yathārhaṁ.
-->

Third plate, obverse.
<lb n="21"/>smābhir arddheṇa mātāpittror ātmanaś ca puṇyābhivṛddhaye saliladhārāpura-
<lb n="22"/>ssareṇācandrārkkasamakālīnākṣayanīye bharadvājasagottrāyāṅgi-
<lb n="23"/>rasavārhaspatyapravāraya charampasvāmine sūryoparāge pratipādito ||
<lb n="24"/>Uktañ ca <space type="binding-hole"/> smṛtiśāstre , vahubhir vvasudhā dattā rājabhis sagarādibhiḥ
<lb n="25"/>yasya yasya yadā bhūmi tasya tasya tadā phalaṁ || ṣaṣṭiṁ varṣasahasrā-
<lb n="26"/>ṇi svargge modati bhūmidaḥ Ākṣeptā cānumantā ca tāny eva narake
<lb n="27"/>vase || svadattā paradattām vā , yo hareta vasundharā sa viṣṭhāyāṁ
<!--	
	23. pratipādito: Hultzsch reads pratipādita and emends pratipāditaḥ.
	25. bhūmi: Hultzsch emends bhūmis.
	27. vase: Hultzsch emends vaset·.
	27. vasundharā: Hultzsch emends vasundharām· |.
-->

Third plate, reverse.
<lb n="28"/>[kṛmi]r bhūtvā pitṛbhis saha pacyate || mā bhutaphalaśaṅkā va[ḥ] paradatte-
<lb n="29"/>[ti] pārthiva || svadānā phalam ānantya {||} parada[ttānupālane] || …
<lb n="30"/>…
<lb n="31"/>[pra]ya<space type="binding-hole"/>cchati ||
<!--	
	28. bhutaphalaśaṅkā: Hultzsch emends bhūd aphalaśaṅkā.
	29. pārthiva: Hultzsch emends pārthivāḥ.
	29. svadānā: Hultzsch emends svadānāt.
	29. ānantya: Hultzsch emends ānantyaṁ.
-->
</p>
